('92', '8', '0', '4', '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p style=\"padding: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(50, 50, 51); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254);\"><strong style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px;\">GILIRANKU MEMBANTUMU</strong></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(50, 50, 51); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254);\">Intan menolak diajak bermain.</p><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(50, 50, 51); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254);\">Raini heran dan bertanya, &ldquo;Ada apa, Intan? Kamu habis menangis?&rdquo;</p><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(50, 50, 51); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254);\">&ldquo;Aku tidak bisa menghitung luas dan keliling persegi panjang,&rdquo; Intan berbisik.</p><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(50, 50, 51); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254);\">Raini tersenyum.</p><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(50, 50, 51); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254);\">&ldquo;Sekarang giliranku membantumu,&rdquo; kata Raini.</p><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(50, 50, 51); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254);\">Dia duduk di sisi Intan. Pensilnya segera beraksi.</p><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(50, 50, 51); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254);\">&ldquo;Begini caranya ....&rdquo;</p><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(50, 50, 51); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254);\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(50, 50, 51); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254);\">Dimana percakapan ini terjadi?</p></body></html>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Disekolah/di ruang kelas', '1762821022', '1762823203', '1', '', '1', '0', '0'),
