('878', '89', '0', '1', '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<h3 data-path-to-node=\"2\"><b data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">My Weekend Plan</span></b></h3><p data-path-to-node=\"3\">This weekend, I have some exciting plans! On Saturday morning, I will go for a hike with my friends. We will explore a nearby trail and enjoy the beautiful views. In the afternoon, I have a soccer match. I have been practicing hard, so I hope we win!</p><p data-path-to-node=\"4\">On Sunday, I will relax at home in the morning. I plan to read a book and watch a movie. In the afternoon, I will visit my grandparents. We always have a great time together. I can\'t wait for the weekend to arrive!</p><ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"6\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\">What will the writer do on Saturday morning?</p></li></ol></body></html>', ' Go for a swim', 'Go for a hike', 'Go shopping', 'Stay at home', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'b', '1772244539', '1772244698', '1', '', '1', '0', '0'),
