('930', '56', '0', '1', '10', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p data-path-to-node=\"9\" id=\"p-rc_b509a27e8973ec63-28\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-411 citation-end-411\" style=\"\">Andi <source-footnote ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c4158699256=\"\" style=\"\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c4158699256=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"39\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span>seorang muslim y<span class=\"citation-410\" style=\"\">ang bertetangga dengan seorang yang berbeda agama. Biasanya setiap hari minggu sore tetangganya tersebut mengadakan acara keagamaan </span><span class=\"citation-409 citation-410\" style=\"\">di rumahnya. Andi tidak membuat keributan ketika acara tersebut berlangsung.</span></span><span class=\"citation-409 citation-410 citation-end-410\"><source-footnote ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c4158699256=\"\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c4158699256=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"40\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><span class=\"citation-409 citation-end-409\"><source-footnote ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c4158699256=\"\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c4158699256=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"41\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c308919232=\"\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c308919232=\"\" _nghost-ng-c4216981734=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p><div _ngcontent-ng-c4216981734=\"\" class=\"source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><p></p><p data-path-to-node=\"10\" id=\"p-rc_b509a27e8973ec63-29\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-407\"></span><span class=\"citation-407 citation-408 citation-end-408\" style=\"\">Sikap yang ditunjukkan Andi adalah<source-footnote ng-version=\"