('1943', '169', '0', '1', '8', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p><b>Data berikut untuk menjawab soal nomor 8-10!</b></p><p>Diberikan data berat badan murid (dalam kg) kelas III SD Nusa sebagai berikut!</p><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td>32</td><td>30</td><td>33</td><td>30</td><td>30</td></tr><tr><td>29</td><td>28</td><td>32</td><td>34</td><td>29</td></tr><tr><td>30</td><td>33</td><td>28</td><td>32</td><td>30</td></tr><tr><td>33</td><td>32</td><td>29</td><td>33</td><td>34</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Tabel yang sesuai dengan data tersebut adalah....</p></body></html>', '<br><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td>Berat Badan (Kg)</td><td>Banyak Murid</td></tr><tr><td>28</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>29</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>30</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>32</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>33</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>34</td><td>2</td></tr></tbody></table></body></html>', '<table class=\"table table-bordered\" style=\"width: 427px; color: rgb(31, 45, 61); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><tbody><tr><td>Berat Badan (Kg)</td><td>Banyak Murid</td></tr><tr><td>28</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>29</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>30</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>32</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>33</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>34</td><td>2</td></tr></tbody></table></body></html>', '<table class=\"table table-bordered\" style=\"width: 427px; color: rgb(31, 45, 61); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><tbody><tr><td>Berat Badan (Kg)</td><td>Banyak Murid</td></tr><tr><td>28</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>29</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>30</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>32</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>33</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>34</td><td>2</td></tr></tbody></table></body></html>', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'c', '1780875476', '1780875476', '0', '', '1', '0', '0'),
